.vercel

# Playwright e2e output (regenerated per run)
test-results/
playwright-report/

# TypeScript incremental build cache. Rewritten by every `tsc --noEmit` and
# `next build`, so tracking it left the tree permanently dirty and the file had
# to be hand-excluded from every commit. Unanchored on purpose, unlike the
# `/logs/` entry in the root .gitignore: that one is a directory NAME that would
# match at any depth, whereas this is a file extension no source file uses, and
# each tsconfig emits its own (tsconfig.tsbuildinfo, tsconfig.test.tsbuildinfo…).
*.tsbuildinfo
